Centuries later, [[Shauna]] gained possession of an Ash Amulet and used it in her battles against the [[Casterwill family]]. Ash was called upon by Shauna [[Venice, Italy]] during an ambush of the [[Huntik Foundation]] as planned by [[Rassimov]]. Ash helped [[Dervish]] defeat [[Sophie Casterwill]]'s [[Sabriel]] but she was defeated by [[Lok Lambert]]'s [[Baselaird]] and [[Cherit]]. {{source|The Secret of Two Generations}}

Shauna invoked Ash alongside Dervish to attack [[Dante Vale]] on the [[Erasmus Bridge]] in [[Rotterdam, Netherlands]]. The pair were, however, defeated by [[Caliban|Powerbonded Caliban]]. {{Source|Den vs Harrison}}

Ash was invoked by Shauna in [[Phoenix]]'s volcano to attack Lok. Lok held Ash off using the [[Willblade]] and Ash was defeated when [[Baselaird|Powerbonded Baselaird]] threw her into the lava pool. {{Source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}
